libproxmox-acme (1.7.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * fix #7749: always serialize in same order, fixing EAB with
    HashiCorp Vault PKI

  * fix #5978: pem parser: relax parsing of chain entries, allowing
    additional information about the certificate chain members, which
    some CA software includes in violation of the spec

  * fix #7155/8131: proxmox-acme: support upper-hex
    mode of _url_encode, used by the alyun, baidu and
    hw DNS plugins

  * acme: fix USER_AGENT variable interpolation in curl calls

  * fix #7851: acme: add missing _mktemp and restore _dbase64 default, used by the oci and transip DNS plugins

  * acme: add missing _url_replace function, used by the yandex cloud DNS plugin ("yc")

  * tests: rewrite check-missing-functions to catch calls in substitutions, and drop false positives

  * build: add $BUILDDIR to gitignore

  * update acme.sh to upstream 3.1.6 tag
    - fix #5147: broken namesilo DNS plugin
    - fix #5519: broken exoscale DNS plugin
    - fix #7321: broken infomaniak DNS plugin
    - fix #7770: broken selfhost DNS plugin
    - fix #8199: broken inwx DNS plugin
    - remove linode v3 DNS plugin (replaced by linode_v4)
    - add dnsmint, hestiacp, hw, myloc, nexdns, opteamax, optidata and rltx DNS
      plugins
    - numerous improvements and fixes to various DNS plugins

 -- Proxmox Support Team <support@proxmox.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 10:00:06 +0100

